{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is designed to use the help of various &quot;<u>ROBOTS</u>&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(<strong>Recommended ROBOT</strong>: Smartphone with internet)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you fool the system into believing that you are <strong>NOT</strong> human?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Play:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the instructions in each question, sometimes by clicking, sometimes by typing,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and answer the questions correctly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Can you select all squares showing blue?</i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Are you able to type a long text in 1 second?</i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Do you know how a DVORAK keyboard looks like?</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't know the answer, do not hesitate to help yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a calculator, use the internet or use your smartphone camera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unless your able to read QR codes by yourself, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this game is designed <strong>NOT</strong> to be solvable without the help of &quot;<u>ROBOTS</u>&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have the feeling, the way you're trying to get the answer is kinda cheating,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >then it is probably one proper <strong>CORRECT</strong> way to clear this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are able to clear this game, without the help of any &quot;<u>ROBOTS</u>&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...then you are probably <strong>NOT</strong> human!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES (after game cleared once):</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CAPTCHA Question Selection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No penalty retry time option</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">NOT RECOMMENDED WAY </span>TO PLAY<span class=\"bb_strike\">:</span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Playing the entire game only in ROBO language.</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Let's Plays and Streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to make let's play videos and/or streaming the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please leave a link to the store page.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3635730?t=1762890276","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635730/e381f6852f2eec2bebe72bb13b15ac3c272e2960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762890276","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635730/dbc6ada00bd1627820aa4da7b8a29aa0e55fa9b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762890276","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635730/dbc6ada00bd1627820aa4da7b8a29aa0e55fa9b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762890276","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is designed to use the help of various &quot;<u>ROBOTS</u>&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(<strong>Recommended ROBOT</strong>: Smartphone with internet)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you fool the system into believing that you are <strong>NOT</strong> human?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Play:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\